# How auto-update treats each template: `<pkg> <tier>`, `#` comments. Unlisted templates are `notify`
# (reported weekly, never bumped). Run `./voidlab tiers` to see every template with its tier.
#   auto    bump, build, test, squash-merge, publish. Leaf apps with no ABI impact only.
#   review  bump, build, test, open a PR and leave it. Merge it and the next daily run publishes it.
#   manual  never bumped by CI: toolchain, libraries other packages link against, session and boot
#           components, held sets. Bump by hand (they need coordinated rebuilds). Reported weekly.
# nvidia is `manual` and is never published. Meta packages have no source and stay unlisted.

